    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d982">

                <pb facs="1119" n="1023" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1023"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Woodford to Mr. Sherman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-12-27"><hi rendition="#italic">December 27,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 101.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of Department’s dispatch No. 82, dated the 2d of December instant, relating to
                    the pardon of the crew of the bark <hi rendition="#italic">Competitor.</hi></p>
                <pb facs="1120" n="1024" xml:id="pg1024"/>
                <p>I have addressed a further note to the Spanish minister of foreign affairs, under
                    date of December 24 instant, conveying to his excellency the gratification felt
                    by the Government at Washington in learning of the clemency of Her Majesty the
                    Queen Regent and its deep appreciation of the generous and humane motives which
                    prompted this act of grace.</p>
                <p>I inclose copy of such note to the Spanish minister, and have the honor to
                    be,</p>
                <p>Very respectfully, yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stewart L. Woodford.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d982-a1.xml" xpointer="d982-a1"/>
            </div>
